    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeleesiinda hinnooda Ng'utamiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ghamneawa barawajeandeaba iyeenya gil eang'oorneegwean orjooga aabwariinyi, nea aba jeedeaba suh duwaawiin ea neapkeaneegwa ak gagatkat fughareengeagwa miyaas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoapkaachi ng'asheega ghayi rugu sibanga ghaydidi ea diigheandida bea Ng'utamiida ea lealnoocheanda aba naweeda giijasoodigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidamadeeda geagasayi anala ng'asheanji bea gideaba damanda huuydean gay ghapka fuga bwariiy shikooda nea gay gwashikeegwa, nea ghwaat geeshta gidagasa sasanuuka nyaawa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayi, “Gwandeenu gissiheeleata ghayi bea hinoadaanyi? Aba gideaba ghang'eada damandida iimeewa gheambaghweanigaasa, goobiideata haleanjeeda sean gida eawoojisu ghang'eada deaghayi sibwada ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iissa gafool mwadaagha ng'asheanji bea huumwaan bea gideaba aba ng'asheanda ASEETA, ghayi geesin humng'eeda, ak gwardu ng'eanyiida aba jeeda beega aba naweeda beega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi mida geanung' ghwaak beega ak goosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheandida ea sinung' ghoamuughu humng'eeda ghamneawa mida ea ng'eanyiida beasta, geetiiw ea ghwahita eaweeda girgweaksiinda ea dea nyariida fuga munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adoofooli ng'asheanji asagi bea huumwaan, orjoogeasu aabwariinyi, bea gideaba aba heeda Ng'utamiida eaweecheanjagi gawuurji sea gweanyeew sagalama, nea gweanyeew sagalama gawuurji eaweecheanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi Ng'utamiida mii lambeech aba heeleesiindaanyi gawuurji gida rarda mwaatkwa gideaba aalaambeach, niny iissa ghamilightaneegwa, nea magassa gideaba gayghwaroat sih, niny gagasa gideaba gayghwanyas sean duukuunooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweeda Ng'utamiida gay ghwahitaayda mareanghweanda, aba eaweedida gay ghwaroat humng'eeda aba nyeashta haw, nea haleanjeeda sean ghayi bea mwadi gayghwanyar aba jeeda beasta, nea ng'eanyiida ea gadiyoojigaaschi mideawa gajeaghwarda goosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iinukwa gajeataarda haleanjeeda sean, gammiisa gideaba gajawoosa fuga uurjiin aba jeeda eaweega ea ghaydidanda ea munyinda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghoamuughu nea ghoanung' ghwalamwajaan hinnooda askwearjeanda ASEETA, aba gideaba humng'eeda gajeayeat ak geenyarja, ak haleanjeeda gayghwanyar aba beasta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba heeleedaanyi geamuughu humng'eedeesh ea ng'eanyiideesh mida jeeda doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi, orjooga aabwariinyi, iinukwa ghoamuughu ng'asheesu, oomajeega ghwahidu niny nea manda badahuukeagwa gidamuy ghana eerukuna badahuukeagwa gidamuy, geaghus hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga ghoanali gideaba gidamilighteayda Ng'utamiideanya gay gwasimaneegwa lealeanooda, ak eara orjeeda giyeanya sibwariiy was Bawlo gang'oorneegwa aba weaghuumeedida siitaw ninyiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean nea gabaloola ng'asheesu gawuurji gida sinda aba jeeda barawajeegaaschi sean. Gwanda haleanjeeda hang'oonyi aba jeenyaawa jea eanal, nea dea dasha ea dea moopta ng'eanyi iissa ghwayam ghoah nyariida, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'ooruutka suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi fugeasu aabwariinyi, iyoobean anala ng'asheesu aba mwadi, asi afura geat, adaghwaadaneegwa ghaat giidiinyeanyeekeaba fiisu, ak ghoanung'wi heeda giibindeang'wa majeek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahisiina heeda aba dagheerjeanduumeeda, ea nalooda Ng'utamiideanya ea lealnoocheanda was Yesu Gristo. Headaanyi gwanda gharbeeda ghamneawa ea ghoah eaweega manda muudeanooda. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
